The following files are copied verbatim into skills/moss-image-prompt-enhancer/:

  SKILL.md
  agents/openai.yaml
  references/layout.md
  scripts/compile_prompt.py
  scripts/test_compile_prompt.py

Their sha256 pins are recorded in tests/integrity.test.mjs and verified by the
test suite. The plugin adds no changes inside those files; DSH-specific runtime
notes are appended at load time by src/index.mjs, and the python compiler is
additionally reimplemented in JavaScript (src/compile.mjs) for the native
moss_compile_prompt tool. The JavaScript port is an independent work licensed
under the MIT license of this repository.
